1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,240
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,480
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,040
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,010
(Episode 5)

5
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:30,500
Who is it this late?

6
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:32,970
(You have a visitor.)

7
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,140
What?

8
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:38,210
What's she doing here this late?

9
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,580
Hey, what are you doing here?

10
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:47,050
Hey, Park Hee Jung!

11
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:50,820
Kim Jung Sun?
Ms. Kim, where are you?

12
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:51,820
- Hey!
- Ms. Kim!

13
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:52,890
Are you crazy?

14
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:54,960
Why are you looking for Ms. Kim
at this hour?

15
00:00:55,090 --> 00:00:56,360
Where's Ms. Kim?

16
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,230
She's away on a shoot.

17
00:00:58,300 --> 00:00:59,560
What about CEO Kang Young Hoon?

18
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:01,400
Why on earth...

19
00:01:01,470 --> 00:01:03,540
are you looking
for the CEO and his wife?

20
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:04,970
Why do you think?

21
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:06,810
I'm going to expose
everything you've done.

22
00:01:08,310 --> 00:01:09,310
What did you say?

23
00:01:09,710 --> 00:01:10,980
Where's Kang Hae Ra?

24
00:01:11,410 --> 00:01:12,680
Oh, is she upstairs?

25
00:01:13,550 --> 00:01:14,550
Hey!

26
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:27,730
Darn it. What the heck?

27
00:01:29,430 --> 00:01:32,030
What... How did you get in here?

28
00:01:41,110 --> 00:01:44,510
How dare you hit my daughter?
Do you have any idea who you are?

29
00:01:48,450 --> 00:01:49,650
Are you insane, lady?

30
00:01:49,910 --> 00:01:51,320
That's right, I've lost it.

31
00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:53,280
Wouldn't you be crazy too?

32
00:01:53,350 --> 00:01:54,890
My daughter was beaten
half to death.

33
00:01:55,490 --> 00:01:58,820
She grabbed me first.
Get your facts straight!

34
00:02:01,860 --> 00:02:04,260
Get your facts straight
before you get cheeky.

35
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,300
Do you know who you are?

36
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:11,770
What do you mean,
do I know who I am?

37
00:02:13,610 --> 00:02:15,070
So you really have no clue...

38
00:02:15,610 --> 00:02:16,740
who you are.

39
00:02:18,010 --> 00:02:19,480
You're...

40
00:02:20,010 --> 00:02:21,010
Move.

41
00:02:24,050 --> 00:02:25,550
What do you think you're doing?

42
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:28,390
I told you to apologize,
and you hit her?

43
00:02:29,550 --> 00:02:34,130
Hee Jung, I was so wrong. Okay?
Please, let it go this one time.

44
00:02:34,730 --> 00:02:37,330
What's wrong with you?
Get up right now!

45
00:02:37,930 --> 00:02:39,730
She's just being immature.

46
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:42,400
I'll talk some sense into her,
so please let it go this once.

47
00:02:42,570 --> 00:02:43,670
Manager Joo!

48
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,000
Stay out of this.

49
00:02:49,810 --> 00:02:51,880
Hee Jung, let's go talk outside.
Okay?

50
00:02:51,940 --> 00:02:53,340
Let go. I said let go of me.

51
00:02:53,410 --> 00:02:54,810
Come on, let's go.

52
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,460
So when is she coming back?

53
00:03:07,690 --> 00:03:09,290
I'm asking
when Kim Jung Sun is coming back!

54
00:03:09,790 --> 00:03:11,360
Come on, Hee Jung.

55
00:03:11,530 --> 00:03:12,960
You told me once, didn't you?

56
00:03:13,530 --> 00:03:16,200
If something was taken from you,
you have to take it back.

57
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,740
So that's what I'm going to do now.

58
00:03:19,070 --> 00:03:21,040
The life that was stolen
from Eun Seol.

59
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:24,140
I'm going to take it back
and return it to Eun Seol.

60
00:03:26,210 --> 00:03:27,280
Hee Jung.

61
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,750
What are you saying?

62
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,120
Why should we give up
half a million dollars?

63
00:03:40,330 --> 00:03:42,390
That's just where we are now.

64
00:03:42,790 --> 00:03:44,800
Are you messing with us?

65
00:03:45,530 --> 00:03:48,000
You told us to be nice to Eun Seol
since we'll get 500,000 dollars,

66
00:03:48,070 --> 00:03:50,340
but now you want us
to just give it up?

67
00:03:51,170 --> 00:03:53,810
Please lower your voice.
Eun Seol will hear you.

68
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:54,870
So what if she does?

69
00:03:55,140 --> 00:03:56,340
We're about to lose
half a million dollars,

70
00:03:56,410 --> 00:03:58,210
and you think I care
what she thinks right now?

71
00:03:58,710 --> 00:04:01,550
What exactly happened?
Tell me what's going on.

72
00:04:02,010 --> 00:04:04,520
Did you actually find
Eun Seol's birth mother?

73
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,090
Yes.

74
00:04:07,890 --> 00:04:08,890
Then what?

75
00:04:09,390 --> 00:04:10,460
I can't...

76
00:04:10,890 --> 00:04:12,060
get into details right now.

77
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:14,130
I'll fill you in
once I figure things out.

78
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:16,760
What? Mom, where are you going?

79
00:04:39,650 --> 00:04:41,790
Grandma, what are you doing?

80
00:04:41,850 --> 00:04:44,420
You.
Get out of this house right now.

81
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,920
Grandma.

82
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:52,130
Why are you bothering her
when she's hurt?

83
00:04:52,330 --> 00:04:55,970
Your mother found your birth mother.

84
00:04:56,030 --> 00:04:57,470
So get out right now.

85
00:04:57,900 --> 00:05:00,240
- Mother!
- Mom, please.

86
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:01,640
Mom.

87
00:05:02,710 --> 00:05:05,140
What's Grandma talking about?

88
00:05:06,380 --> 00:05:08,180
You found my birth mother?

89
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:10,980
Is that true?

90
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:13,620
Eun Seol...

91
00:05:14,690 --> 00:05:15,990
Well, the thing is...

92
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:18,120
I'm asking you if it's true.

93
00:05:19,790 --> 00:05:22,090
Yes, it is, but...

94
00:05:23,030 --> 00:05:24,030
Why?

95
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,530
Why did you look for her?

96
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,970
Is it because you don't want
to raise me anymore?

97
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,500
How could you say
something like that?

98
00:05:32,570 --> 00:05:34,040
That's not it.

99
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:36,240
Then why did you look for her?

100
00:05:37,380 --> 00:05:38,610
Calm down, Eun Seol.

101
00:05:39,010 --> 00:05:41,210
Your mom must have her reasons.

102
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:43,410
Her reasons? What reasons?

103
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:44,850
Reasons to abandon me?

104
00:05:45,020 --> 00:05:48,020
Abandon you?
Why would I abandon you?

105
00:05:51,590 --> 00:05:54,360
What are you doing?
Why are you packing a bag?

106
00:05:54,530 --> 00:05:55,730
You were going to abandon me anyway.

107
00:05:55,790 --> 00:05:57,330
What's wrong with leaving
on my own terms...

108
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:58,500
before I get kicked out?

109
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,660
How could you?

110
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,400
My gosh.

111
00:06:05,970 --> 00:06:09,070
Why would you slap her
when she's already banged up?

112
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:16,580
Eun Seol, I'm sorry.
I'm sorry about everything.

113
00:06:17,010 --> 00:06:18,680
So please...

114
00:06:20,690 --> 00:06:22,590
Don't even think about
looking for me again.

115
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,730
- Eun Seol!
- How could she...

116
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:30,800
Just let her go.
This was bound to happen eventually.

117
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,920
I need to talk to you.

118
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,620
What did she mean about me
not knowing who I really am?

119
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:59,390
That woman said it.
She asked if I knew who I was.

120
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,990
What did she mean?

121
00:07:03,030 --> 00:07:04,500
What do you think she meant?

122
00:07:04,660 --> 00:07:06,700
I'm asking because I don't know.

123
00:07:07,300 --> 00:07:09,270
If you don't know, how would I?

124
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:12,100
- You can go now.
- Manager Joo.

125
00:07:12,670 --> 00:07:14,040
Didn't you hear me say get out?

126
00:07:14,770 --> 00:07:18,980
Also, I'm Ms. Joo to you,
not just Manager Joo.

127
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:21,010
Don't talk down to me again.

128
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:25,220
Are you acting like this
because my mom and dad aren't here?

129
00:07:27,220 --> 00:07:29,120
Is that why you're doing this to me?

130
00:07:31,990 --> 00:07:32,990
Kang Hae Ra.

131
00:07:34,390 --> 00:07:36,060
Please, just listen to me.

132
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:39,360
You just have to do as I say.

133
00:07:40,230 --> 00:07:41,270
Do you understand?

134
00:07:43,900 --> 00:07:45,140
If you understand, then leave.

135
00:07:59,580 --> 00:08:00,820
Yes.

136
00:08:01,050 --> 00:08:02,520
Find me someone.

137
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:06,890
A gambler or a junkie,
someone who needs cash fast.

138
00:08:08,660 --> 00:08:09,660
Aren't you heading home?

139
00:08:10,130 --> 00:08:11,500
I was about to.

140
00:08:11,500 --> 00:08:12,960
- See you tomorrow.
- Sure.

141
00:08:16,670 --> 00:08:18,770
So if I get this done,
I get 100,000 dollars, right?

142
00:08:28,850 --> 00:08:32,150
I can do this. I've got this.

143
00:08:33,750 --> 00:08:36,120
Let's do it. Come on.

144
00:08:37,020 --> 00:08:38,920
(Haeryang Goshiwon)

145
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:57,210
(My Dearest Mom)

146
00:09:16,230 --> 00:09:18,960
Eun Seol, answer your phone. Please.

147
00:09:32,740 --> 00:09:33,740
The person you are trying to reach
is unavailable.

148
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:16,590
I can't do this.

149
00:10:17,090 --> 00:10:18,520
I just can't do this.

150
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:29,070
Excuse me.
Could you roll down your window?

151
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:33,440
Have you been drinking?

152
00:10:35,640 --> 00:10:36,770
Sir?

153
00:10:37,880 --> 00:10:39,740
What is with that guy?

154
00:10:39,940 --> 00:10:40,950
What?

155
00:10:41,650 --> 00:10:43,450
How incompetent can you be?

156
00:11:05,100 --> 00:11:06,140
(Cha Seok Jin)

157
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:11,410
(Cha Seok Jin)

158
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:19,050
(Incoming call: Cha Seok Jin)

159
00:11:22,750 --> 00:11:23,820
Hello?

160
00:11:27,290 --> 00:11:28,560
What happened to your lip?

161
00:11:30,090 --> 00:11:31,530
It's nothing.

162
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:36,700
Anyway, is something up?

163
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,840
Yes.

164
00:11:41,410 --> 00:11:42,770
What is it?

165
00:11:43,670 --> 00:11:45,040
Is it something bad?

166
00:11:48,050 --> 00:11:49,350
Well, I...

167
00:11:50,780 --> 00:11:54,650
I've decided to study abroad.

168
00:12:06,500 --> 00:12:08,700
It's not like
that's bad news or anything.

169
00:12:12,940 --> 00:12:14,340
It's not bad news?

170
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:19,080
I'm leaving
and that's not bad news to you?

171
00:12:24,350 --> 00:12:25,920
Are you really okay with this?

172
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:29,650
It doesn't bother you at all
that I'm leaving?

173
00:12:31,060 --> 00:12:32,920
Well, how am I supposed to feel?

174
00:12:34,530 --> 00:12:35,530
What?

175
00:12:36,130 --> 00:12:37,860
Are we in a relationship
or something?

176
00:12:40,430 --> 00:12:41,870
We're not.

177
00:12:51,810 --> 00:12:53,010
I see.

178
00:12:53,810 --> 00:12:55,910
So I was nothing to you.

179
00:12:57,180 --> 00:12:58,880
I guess I just got the wrong idea.

180
00:13:02,490 --> 00:13:03,850
Fine, I get it.

181
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,760
Now that I know how you feel,
I'll be going.

182
00:13:39,690 --> 00:13:41,830
What are you doing out here?

183
00:13:41,890 --> 00:13:43,630
We're here on Ms. Joo's orders.

184
00:14:02,780 --> 00:14:03,950
How can I help you?

185
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:07,450
I'm here to see Kim Jung Sun.

186
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:09,650
That's not possible. Please leave.

187
00:14:09,650 --> 00:14:11,860
Can you at least
give her a message for me?

188
00:14:11,990 --> 00:14:13,390
Tell her I'm here
about her daughter.

189
00:14:13,390 --> 00:14:14,690
I said you need to leave.

190
00:14:18,930 --> 00:14:20,100
I'm home.

191
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:21,830
Welcome home, Ma'am.

192
00:14:23,330 --> 00:14:25,940
But what's with
the guards out front?

193
00:14:26,170 --> 00:14:29,470
Well, we've had some strange people
coming around lately.

194
00:14:29,540 --> 00:14:31,940
- Strange people?
- Stalkers.

195
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,210
Again?

196
00:14:36,410 --> 00:14:40,020
By any chance,
did anything happen on set today?

197
00:14:42,290 --> 00:14:44,090
Thankfully, no.

198
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,490
No strange calls for you either?

199
00:14:46,690 --> 00:14:49,260
You know I don't answer
unsaved numbers.

200
00:14:50,230 --> 00:14:52,900
Good. Don't ever answer them.

201
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,400
Of course not.

202
00:14:54,500 --> 00:14:56,100
Gosh, I'm so sick of this.

203
00:14:56,970 --> 00:14:58,770
Tell the guards to be alert.

204
00:15:00,070 --> 00:15:01,070
Yes, ma'am.

205
00:15:14,290 --> 00:15:15,520
Mom, I'm home.

206
00:15:16,050 --> 00:15:19,220
Oh, you're home?
Go wash up. I'll make you dinner.

207
00:15:21,060 --> 00:15:22,330
I don't need dinner.

208
00:15:23,530 --> 00:15:26,000
Still no word from Eun Seol?

209
00:15:27,130 --> 00:15:28,130
No.

210
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:31,270
That brat.
She isn't answering my calls either.

211
00:15:32,540 --> 00:15:34,140
She's being so difficult.

212
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,540
Don't say that.

213
00:15:36,170 --> 00:15:38,210
She's hurt enough as it is.

214
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:45,880
What's with that look on your face?

215
00:15:46,450 --> 00:15:48,120
They're just DMs.

216
00:15:48,590 --> 00:15:49,590
DMs?

217
00:15:50,190 --> 00:15:52,220
I posted some workout pictures
on social media,

218
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:54,120
and my DMs are blowing up.

219
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:00,360
That's right.

220
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,370
There's that option.

221
00:16:04,470 --> 00:16:05,570
Mom.

222
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:07,970
Seok Jin said
he'll go study abroad with me.

223
00:16:09,140 --> 00:16:10,370
So he decided?

224
00:16:10,570 --> 00:16:12,640
Did you convince him? How?

225
00:16:12,880 --> 00:16:14,010
How else?

226
00:16:14,350 --> 00:16:16,680
I told him to take his mother along.

227
00:16:16,980 --> 00:16:18,980
- What?
- Come on.

228
00:16:18,980 --> 00:16:20,920
Did you have to go that far?

229
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:24,790
Well, Hae Ra was making such a fuss.

230
00:16:25,220 --> 00:16:28,190
Also, it'd be great
if the treatment in the US...

231
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:30,430
helps So Yeon get better.

232
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:33,900
No wonder.
I knew it was too good to be true.

233
00:16:34,130 --> 00:16:37,940
Seok Jin's perfect minus the fact
that he's too much of a devoted son.

234
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:40,470
Why is that a problem?
There's nothing wrong with it.

235
00:16:40,700 --> 00:16:42,670
You've never had a mother-in-law,
so you wouldn't know.

236
00:16:43,170 --> 00:16:45,580
Dad knows how stressful
in-laws can be, right?

237
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:47,750
There you go talking nonsense again.

238
00:16:48,510 --> 00:16:49,610
You're not going there to have fun,

239
00:16:49,680 --> 00:16:51,320
so get your act together.

240
00:16:51,620 --> 00:16:52,850
If I hear any strange rumors
about you,

241
00:16:52,950 --> 00:16:55,020
I'll have you back here immediately.
Understood?

242
00:16:55,090 --> 00:16:56,290
Don't worry.

243
00:16:56,450 --> 00:16:58,020
Manager Joo will handle
the tickets...

244
00:16:59,790 --> 00:17:00,790
I mean,

245
00:17:01,460 --> 00:17:02,930
Ms. Joo will be handling that,
right?

246
00:17:03,590 --> 00:17:05,700
Of course I will.

247
00:17:10,770 --> 00:17:13,300
- See you tomorrow, Eun Seol.
- You too.

248
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:27,650
Can we talk for a minute?

249
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:41,000
I'm leaving tomorrow.

250
00:17:45,770 --> 00:17:47,000
I wish you well.

251
00:17:48,940 --> 00:17:50,210
Is this how it's going to be?

252
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:54,380
Does it really not matter to you
if I leave?

253
00:17:58,250 --> 00:17:59,920
Did we really mean nothing
to each other?

254
00:18:01,490 --> 00:18:02,850
After we nearly died together,

255
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:04,590
you're saying we meant nothing
to each other?

256
00:18:05,060 --> 00:18:06,960
What do you want from me?

257
00:18:07,090 --> 00:18:08,090
Ko Eun Seol.

258
00:18:08,660 --> 00:18:09,930
Am I the one who's leaving?

259
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:14,300
You're the one who's leaving.
Did I tell you to go?

260
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,670
You're going because you want to.

261
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:20,400
So why are you angry at me?

262
00:18:20,470 --> 00:18:22,770
I'm the one
who should be angry right now,

263
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:25,110
so why are you getting mad at me?

264
00:18:27,340 --> 00:18:29,110
If I asked you not to go,

265
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:32,850
would you stay?

266
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:41,560
See? I didn't think so.

267
00:18:43,130 --> 00:18:45,600
You'd go
even if I asked you to stay.

268
00:18:47,970 --> 00:18:49,670
Am I okay with it?

269
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:52,870
No. I feel like I'm being abandoned,

270
00:18:52,940 --> 00:18:54,970
and my heart is breaking.

271
00:18:56,540 --> 00:18:58,140
But I'm holding all of that in...

272
00:18:58,210 --> 00:19:00,380
and trying to send you off
on good terms,

273
00:19:01,310 --> 00:19:03,250
so what more do you want from me?

274
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:07,350
What more do you expect from me?

275
00:19:12,960 --> 00:19:15,630
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

276
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:23,200
Even after I leave,
I'll never forget you.

277
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:26,440
I'll call you every day, text you,

278
00:19:26,670 --> 00:19:27,970
and email you.

279
00:19:28,910 --> 00:19:31,340
I'll never forget you,
so promise me...

280
00:19:32,580 --> 00:19:34,180
you won't forget me either.

281
00:19:38,550 --> 00:19:39,950
Promise me, come on.

282
00:19:44,860 --> 00:19:46,060
You promised.

283
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:49,130
We'll see each other again, okay?

284
00:20:12,550 --> 00:20:13,950
Please put the luggage in the car.

285
00:20:16,190 --> 00:20:19,190
Why isn't she down?
What if she misses her flight?

286
00:20:21,660 --> 00:20:23,630
Mom, Dad, I'm leaving now.

287
00:20:24,090 --> 00:20:26,660
If you can't handle it,
you can come back anytime.

288
00:20:26,830 --> 00:20:27,830
What kind of talk is that?

289
00:20:28,130 --> 00:20:29,670
Once you start something,
you have to see it through.

290
00:20:29,870 --> 00:20:33,140
Don't worry. I won't come back
until you call for me.

291
00:20:33,970 --> 00:20:35,370
We'll get going then.

292
00:20:35,370 --> 00:20:36,870
- Sure.
- Let's go.

293
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:38,910
Mom, Dad, bye.

294
00:20:39,340 --> 00:20:40,340
Bye.

295
00:20:53,190 --> 00:20:56,360
It's been a while, Team Leader Kim.
Is everything good?

296
00:20:58,700 --> 00:20:59,730
A strange DM?

297
00:21:00,260 --> 00:21:03,500
Yes. For the past few days,
actress Kim Jung Sun's account...

298
00:21:03,570 --> 00:21:05,670
has been getting
the exact same DM over and over.

299
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:07,500
I thought you should take a look.

300
00:21:08,710 --> 00:21:10,310
What's the sender's username?

301
00:21:11,210 --> 00:21:13,480
It's parkheejung0708.

302
00:21:15,350 --> 00:21:17,580
Okay, I understand.

303
00:21:17,980 --> 00:21:21,590
Don't say anything to Ms. Kim.
She'll only worry.

304
00:21:29,130 --> 00:21:30,290
(Hello. My Name is Park Hee Jung.)

305
00:21:30,360 --> 00:21:31,800
(I need to speak with you
about your daughter.)

306
00:21:31,860 --> 00:21:32,860
Hello.

307
00:21:33,300 --> 00:21:35,070
My name is Park Hee Jung.

308
00:21:36,030 --> 00:21:38,040
I need to speak with you
about your daughter,

309
00:21:38,740 --> 00:21:40,070
so please agree to meet me.

310
00:21:47,110 --> 00:21:49,910
(Actress, Chairwoman of
Cheongma Scholarship Foundation)

311
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:53,880
(jungsun0613 sent a message.)

312
00:21:54,580 --> 00:21:56,920
- She replied.
- This is Kim Jung Sun.

313
00:21:57,420 --> 00:21:59,190
I apologize for the late reply.

314
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:01,430
Tonight at nine,

315
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:04,330
let's meet on the rooftop
of Serim Tower in Gasan-dong.

316
00:22:05,500 --> 00:22:06,500
Tonight?

317
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:13,700
Thank you. Goodbye.

318
00:22:19,010 --> 00:22:20,640
By nine o'clock tonight,

319
00:22:21,380 --> 00:22:23,480
come to the rooftop of Serim Tower
in Gasan-dong.

320
00:22:24,480 --> 00:22:26,150
I'll be waiting for you,

321
00:22:26,650 --> 00:22:27,650
so you have to come.

322
00:23:02,120 --> 00:23:03,450
The doors are closing.

323
00:23:17,230 --> 00:23:18,470
The doors are closing.

324
00:23:34,380 --> 00:23:36,750
I just got here. Where are you at?

325
00:23:36,820 --> 00:23:41,730
(I just got here. Where are you at?)

326
00:23:43,890 --> 00:23:45,630
I'm on the rooftop as well.

327
00:23:48,200 --> 00:23:50,670
Ms. Kim, where are you?

328
00:24:15,860 --> 00:24:17,060
There you are.

329
00:24:17,930 --> 00:24:20,360
Hello. I'm the one
who contacted you...

330
00:24:31,070 --> 00:24:32,110
It's been a while.

331
00:24:32,810 --> 00:24:33,810
What are you doing here?

332
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:37,480
Where's Ms. Kim?
Why are you here instead?

333
00:24:37,550 --> 00:24:39,250
Because I'm the one
who asked you to come.

334
00:24:39,850 --> 00:24:40,880
Why?

335
00:24:41,220 --> 00:24:43,290
Did you think Kim Jung Sun
actually replied?

336
00:24:44,520 --> 00:24:45,790
How naive.

337
00:24:49,630 --> 00:24:51,090
Are you going to keep trying
to stop me?

338
00:24:51,860 --> 00:24:54,360
Fine, just you try.

339
00:24:55,100 --> 00:24:56,870
Let's see how long
you can keep this up.

340
00:24:57,500 --> 00:24:59,170
I'm asking this of you
one last time.

341
00:25:00,840 --> 00:25:02,940
Keep that matter a secret.

342
00:25:04,210 --> 00:25:05,940
I already told you I won't.

343
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:07,240
You...

344
00:25:08,410 --> 00:25:10,110
Are you sure you won't regret this?

345
00:25:11,010 --> 00:25:12,750
What? Regret?

346
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:15,650
Hey, Park Hee Jung.

347
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:16,820
Why do you keep saying my name?

348
00:25:30,230 --> 00:25:32,940
Why? Feeling dizzy?

349
00:25:36,410 --> 00:25:38,040
What do you think you're doing?

350
00:25:55,790 --> 00:25:57,330
(My Daughter)

351
00:25:57,390 --> 00:25:59,560
What did you just spray on me?

352
00:26:00,100 --> 00:26:01,230
See?

353
00:26:02,330 --> 00:26:04,530
You should've taken
this last chance.

354
00:26:06,800 --> 00:26:10,340
All right.
I get it now, so just stop.

355
00:26:11,070 --> 00:26:13,740
I'll keep it a secret.

356
00:26:15,150 --> 00:26:16,350
Please, just stop.

357
00:26:18,650 --> 00:26:20,980
(Danger: Keep Out)

358
00:26:21,950 --> 00:26:22,950
No.

359
00:26:24,090 --> 00:26:25,420
It's too late now.

360
00:26:26,290 --> 00:26:28,760
(Danger: Keep Out)

361
00:26:35,630 --> 00:26:36,630
(Danger: Keep Out)

362
00:26:58,050 --> 00:27:00,690
The person you are trying to reach
is unavailable.

363
00:28:19,940 --> 00:28:20,940
Mom.

364
00:28:21,770 --> 00:28:22,770
Mom?

365
00:28:42,560 --> 00:28:43,560
No...

366
00:28:46,930 --> 00:28:48,900
It can't be true. It can't be.

367
00:28:49,970 --> 00:28:52,500
It can't be. No...

368
00:28:54,500 --> 00:28:56,670
Please, it can't be.

369
00:29:00,680 --> 00:29:01,780
No...

370
00:29:03,980 --> 00:29:04,980
No.

371
00:29:09,950 --> 00:29:12,960
No...

372
00:29:13,120 --> 00:29:16,930
No, it can't be.

373
00:29:17,260 --> 00:29:21,630
That can't be Mom. No way.

374
00:29:24,670 --> 00:29:25,970
That can't be Mom.

375
00:29:28,710 --> 00:29:31,370
No... No way.

376
00:29:32,540 --> 00:29:35,080
Please, no.

377
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:38,250
No...

378
00:29:44,990 --> 00:29:46,920
Mom!

379
00:29:50,960 --> 00:29:52,660
Somebody, please help!

380
00:29:53,130 --> 00:29:55,100
Please, Mom...

381
00:29:55,500 --> 00:30:00,240
Oh no, what do I do? Mom!

382
00:30:02,540 --> 00:30:05,210
Somebody, please help!

383
00:30:34,270 --> 00:30:38,240
(A Trap Called Desire)

384
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:39,440
What on earth happened?

385
00:30:39,640 --> 00:30:41,310
Hey, Eun Seol. Ko Eun Seol!

386
00:30:41,910 --> 00:30:43,650
I think I'm going to get expelled.

387
00:30:44,110 --> 00:30:45,780
What's wrong with you?

388
00:30:46,150 --> 00:30:48,020
I sent you to fashion school
to develop your skills,

389
00:30:48,080 --> 00:30:49,120
and you resort to stealing?

390
00:30:49,350 --> 00:30:50,550
Manager Joo said that?

391
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:52,190
That she wants to be PR director
for the foundation?

392
00:30:52,260 --> 00:30:54,390
You should just stick to handling
the CEO's family matters.

393
00:30:54,690 --> 00:30:55,930
Know your place.

394
00:30:56,130 --> 00:30:58,700
Ko Eun Seol, you're under arrest
for the murder of Park Hee Jung.

395
00:30:59,130 --> 00:31:02,270
Why would I kill my own mom? Why?

396
00:31:03,300 --> 00:31:05,640
I really didn't kill her!

397
00:31:08,200 --> 00:31:10,210
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
